    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογιστ-έον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must reckon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				264.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἀπό</span> . . <i>one must
				deduct</i> from.., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τροφὴν . . ἀπὸ τῶν ἑβδομήκοντα
					μνῶν . . λογιστέον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					27.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must impute</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					1.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one must take into account</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				62a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must reason</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				531.9
			</span></i>.</div>
